# Code owners. One file at the repo root is read by GitHub, GitLab and Gitea.
# Replace @OWNER with your user or group before you use this template.
#
# Order matters: the last matching pattern wins. Verifier paths are listed
# explicitly at the end so a change to them always needs the owner, even if
# you later hand other folders to other teams.
# GitLab note: enforcing code owner approval needs a paid tier. On GitLab Free
# the file still shows owners, and scripts/verifier-guard.sh plus a protected
# main branch do the enforcing.

# Everything
*                               @OWNER

# Why the extra CODEOWNERS paths: GitHub and GitLab read .github/, .gitlab/ and docs/
# CODEOWNERS before the root file, so a new one would replace root ownership.
# .gitignore decides which files the checks see at all.
#
# Verifiers: never changed together with the content they verify.
# scripts/verifier-guard.sh reads the paths between the markers below.
# Supported forms, gitignore style (valid on GitHub, GitLab and Gitea):
#   /exact/file and /folder/  anchored at the repo root. Without the trailing slash,
#                             /folder matches the file or everything under it.
#   name or *.ext             no leading slash and no other slash: matches that
#                             name at any depth. It may glob. Use it for config
#                             files the tools read from any directory.
# BEGIN verifier paths
/Makefile                       @OWNER
/scripts/                       @OWNER
/tools.versions                 @OWNER
/package.json                   @OWNER
/package-lock.json              @OWNER
/requirements-lint.txt          @OWNER
/ci/                            @OWNER
/.github/workflows/             @OWNER
/.gitlab-ci.yml                 @OWNER
/.gitleaks.toml                 @OWNER
/.markdownlint-cli2.yaml        @OWNER
/.yamllint.yaml                 @OWNER
/lychee.toml                    @OWNER
/.claude/settings.json          @OWNER
/.dockerignore                  @OWNER
/CODEOWNERS                     @OWNER
/.github/CODEOWNERS             @OWNER
/.gitlab/CODEOWNERS             @OWNER
/docs/CODEOWNERS                @OWNER
/.gitignore                     @OWNER
/.gitleaksignore                @OWNER
/.lycheeignore                  @OWNER
/.gitattributes                 @OWNER
.shellcheckrc                   @OWNER
.markdownlint*                  @OWNER
# END verifier paths
